@ Index:   Currency Conversion: DRC Francs -> USD
@ Author:  Jonathan M. Cameron
@
@ Variables:  Uses 'Taux', number of DRC Francs per USD
@   - Initialize 'Taux':  2400 STO 'Taux'
@ 
@ Input:   Number of DRC Francs to convert to USD
@ Output:  Number USD
@
@ Test:  2400 USD ==> 1
@
@ Version: 1

LBL ‘USD’
  RCL ‘Taux’
  ÷
